Package: lifr
Type: Package
Title: Import, Plot, and Report Laser-Induced Fluorescence (LIF) Borehole Logs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Matthew", "Jorden",
                  email = "matthew.jorden@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Tools for working with Laser-Induced Fluorescence (LIF) borehole
    logs from high-resolution site characterization surveys (UVOST, TarGOST,
    and similar direct-push fluorescence probes). Import raw '.lif.dat' log
    files into a tidy data frame that keeps every recorded channel, join
    boring coordinates, mask known-bad depth intervals with a recorded audit
    trail, summarise and plot depth profiles, plan-view boring maps and site
    summary charts, and render a self-contained HTML, Markdown, or PDF site
    report.
